  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1 - Ensuring a healthy beginning for the generations of the future, focused on improving health services for pregnant women, new-borns and children of illnesses driving a high burden of morbidity and
Mortality.
2 - Reducing environmental impact of healthcare waste: removing plastics from land and oceans, focused on implementing a demonstration project where a circular economy model is successful in recycling health facility waste into usable building materials.
3 - Health Security: improving safety and access for all vaccines, focused on improving government capacity to deliver safe vaccines for routine childhood immunization and Covid-19 programs to all areas of the country to meet the national coverage targets</narrative>
